WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
On I go, searching for...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
The past that was stolen from me

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Wandering on through...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
This city, so strange to see

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Choked by the scent of flames that seems to...

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Cling to me

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Didn't we both say our goodbyes...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
And go our separate ways?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
When you see the face of hell...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
It will squeeze your heart dry

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Fighting on seems so pointless now

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
If this must be my fate...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Then I'll make my mind up now

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
So, please, won't you just leave me be...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Another day

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Oh, will tomorrow hold something new to see?

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:40.170
The task force's objective is to secretly
approach enemy HQ determine the situation,

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:43.630
and then attack.

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:49.330
As he has already infiltrated the base once before,
Chirico will be the one to lead the strike.

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:58.330
The most important point of the mission
is to remain undiscovered until arriving there.

00:01:58.330 --> 00:02:01.880
Kan Yu, you will support any action
Chirico takes once there.

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:03.330
A suggestion, sir!

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:05.040
What?

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:08.960
The leader of the attack should have
a proven success record.

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:13.170
To ensure this mission runs smoothly,
I should lead all phases of the operation

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:15.920
to ensure a uniformity of command
that'll guarantee success!

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:19.630
You do have a point.

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:23.380
But we need Chirico's experience for this mission.

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:28.210
I don't know what experience that may be,
but at least tell us what the real objective is!

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:30.080
That's a military secret!

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:34.250
You will command only within
the limits set for you!

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:41.920
Captain, you'll understand later.

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:46.830
For now, support Chirico
and make sure the mission succeeds.

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:49.420
Yes, sir.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:58.000
Upriver

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:22.420
The calm before the storm.

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:25.960
This battle may finally end Kummen's civil war.

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:29.040
Well, another war'll start someplace else.

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:31.460
We won't be goin' hungry any time soon.

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:37.170
So many villagers, killed.

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:39.250
Caught in the midst of the war.

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:43.880
The stench I smelled seemed full of
the anguish of the dead.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.960
I've had enough of fighting!

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.250
But I'll hang on, just a little bit longer.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:57.380
Peace will soon come to this country.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:01.330
And then nothing will stop
Kummen from modernizing.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:12.130
The Veela!

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:13.460
Hide!

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.880
I'm gonna shoot those little pests down!

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:33.790
Wait!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:35.880
Kiderra, don't!

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:38.290
Have you forgotten? This is a secret mission.

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:41.330
I'm not used to this crap!

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:43.630
These damned spook ops!

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:49.920
What's the difference how we kill the Veela?

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:51.130
Chirico.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:55.210
I get the feeling there's more to
this mission's objectives.

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:59.080
Hey, do you know anything about it?

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:14.000
Hell, whatever. I got no complaints as long as
I get my bonus for wasting Veela ATs.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.000
Something's coming.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:25.250
Great, time to play hide and seek again.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:29.750
We should stop that boat and search it.

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:31.330
We should let them pass.

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:32.380
What?!

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:34.920
We'd just be revealing who we really are.

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:37.580
What are you talking about?
They could be Veela spies!

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:39.580
It'd be safer to let them pass.

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:41.210
Are you defying me?!

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:44.000
Until we reach the enemy base, I'm in command!

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.170
Now shut up!

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:46.460
You're right, sir...

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:49.170
Stop that boat! We're searching it!

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:51.000
Stop! Stop!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.540
Search it!

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:08.580
Outta the way!

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:25.330
Nothing here out of the ordinary, sir!

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:28.330
Let 'em go.

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:30.210
All right, go!

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:50.290
Stop it! There's no reason to kill them!

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:03.790
You son of a bitch! They did nothing wrong!

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:06.330
This mission is still secret.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:08.670
We can't overlook anyone we can't trust.

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.580
A small sacrifice for the greater goal.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:12.920
A small sacrifice?

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:14.920
We're talking about people's lives here!

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:16.420
Back off, Potaria.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.630
Just back off.

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:27.290
I saw an antenna on the bow of that boat.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:31.830
A commander must be vigilant and
able to make sharp decisions.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.540
This river's quiet.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:38.540
Except for that gunfire you might hear!

00:07:56.330 --> 00:08:01.250
Hey, Chirico. Do you take over command
once we get there?

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:04.170
Is that why he's got such a bug up his ass?

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.290
I'm just following orders.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:09.960
What sort of orders?

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:19.250
You're lookin' for Kanjelman's head
on a platter, right, Potaria?

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:21.250
That's right.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:22.920
So what's the problem?

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:25.670
We have different goals,
but we're all going to the same place.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:27.000
Well put.

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:32.000
Chirico, you're really acting nervous this time.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.580
Like you're goin' to meet
your girlfriend or something!

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:46.040
Over here! Hurry!

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:58.130
Soon our decisive battle will begin.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.630
As will Kummen's major offensive.

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:04.710
Chirico will have to come.

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:10.420
But this time, the moment I see him
is the moment he dies.

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:14.210
This time, I'll be ready for him.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:20.250
Ypsilon, the mission briefing is starting.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:21.830
Yes, sir. I'm coming.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:35.920
The Kummen main forces and
each Assemble base are already prepared.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:37.790
Intelligence shows they're all just standing by.

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:40.670
They've moved slower than we expected.

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:43.960
Our forces stand at full battle readiness.

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:47.790
We believe the enemy's main forces
are just being cautious.

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:51.290
The question is which route will
the main force take to get here?

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:54.710
Up the Munamera River would be the most logical.

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:58.920
A quick and decisive strike...

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:00.420
Countermeasures?

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:03.670
All set, sir. That area's locked up tight.

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:07.170
If the Melkian and Kummen armies
have joined forces

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:09.250
then their plan may be much more complex.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.130
You're right.

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:13.170
Don't worry. We'll deal with that when it happens.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.540
We have options.

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:19.250
To raise our morale, I believe it will be
necessary to defeat their main army first.

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:23.380
I'd like you to order my special AT team
out against them.

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:26.000
Ypsilon, don't be rash.

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.710
We still have time to see how they'll move.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.750
Yes, sir.

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:34.210
Issue the order to tighten security!

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:44.210
What's that?

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:45.380
Ramoh temple.

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:51.500
Lively place, ain't it?

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:55.000
Monks and worshippers have
gathered here since ancient times.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.330
It's famous.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.790
We're stopping here. Slow the boat.

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:00.460
We shouldn't.

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:02.750
You again? Now what?

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:04.330
This mission is secret.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.500
We should get to the base as quietly as possible.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:07.580
That's enough!

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:11.630
It's our duty to remove any dangers
that may interfere with us reaching it!

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:16.380
Didn't you say small sacrifices
must be made for the greater goal?

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:21.540
If those boat people contacted them already,
we're in danger.

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:25.830
That goes double in areas with
a high concentration of the enemy.

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:30.710
Just because that boat had an antenna
didn't make those people Veela spies.

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:32.170
We should just pass this by-

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.710
I'm in command here!

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:37.750
What if they outnumber us?
Or they alert Veela intelligence?

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:40.130
Shut up! I know what I'm doing!

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:45.250
Would you just decide already?

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:47.460
AT team, prep for battle!

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:49.250
All right, here we go!

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:36.290
Is that clear? If we find any Veela
we don't let any of them survive!

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:37.290
Let's go!

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:50.670
It's suspicious.

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:52.580
It sure as hell is.

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:56.630
I've had enough of these monks
and their worshippers!

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:06.330
I am the chief priest of this temple.

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:11.710
You know the war's being fought near here.

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.380
We're just making a quick check.

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:16.330
The war has nothing to do with us.

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:18.880
There isn't a single soldier here.

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:22.750
Now please, leave this sacred place.

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:26.210
Save the preaching for my funeral, pal.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:27.960
Split up and search!

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:28.960
Yes, sir!

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:55.500
Outta the way!

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:57.790
Move!

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:12.170
An anti-AT cannon!

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:13.420
Stop, please!

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:17.710
No one is allowed inside there!
Please don't go-

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:18.830
Shut up!

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:20.380
That's enough! We're leaving.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:21.380
Yes, sir!

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:32.750
Well?

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:34.130
Nothing unusual.

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:40.080
Chirico, you seem to be taking
this mission very seriously.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:43.080
If you think you're the only one who knows,
you're dead wrong.

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:47.670
Don't play dumb. I mean our real objective.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:52.420
Well, when we get to it,
we'll see how good a leader you really are.

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:56.460
Typical temple.
Not even a water pistol lying around.

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:58.080
Just priests and worshippers.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:14:59.380
Same here.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:01.380
Let's go.

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:17.750
What's that?

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:20.670
A storehouse, sir.

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:22.210
Open it.

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:23.380
Yes, sir

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:34.250
Lot of food you got here.

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:38.130
Many of our worshippers spend
the night here when they come.

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:39.580
This is donated.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:49.130
The worshippers do a lot of drinking, do they?

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:52.330
No, it's... offerings for the gods!

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:55.540
Your gods must be alcoholics!

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:02.500
You could feed a unit for a month with this.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:27.710
Hey! Check out that boat!

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:28.580
Yes, sir!

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:38.920
It's just loaded with vegetables, sir.

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:41.250
Set it loose. Do it!

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:42.000
Yes, sir!

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:45.960
What's his problem?

00:16:46.210 --> 00:16:48.960
That boat's also got an antenna on it.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.540
I suppose the temple needs ammunition, too!

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.830
Return fire!

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:15.750
Dammit! He just woke the baby!

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:23.630
You see?! I knew this was a Veela base!

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:42.290
I'm goin' in!

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:48.920
Get out the anti-AT cannons
and the AT ammo. Hurry!

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:58.630
Protect the boat, no matter what!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:04.920
You'll pay for that!

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:27.630
Uh-oh! Let's get outta here!

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:07.790
You would have just ignored these Veela, Chirico?

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:10.500
I was just trying to follow orders.

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:12.920
But that's useless now.

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:15.460
Our secret mission's a complete failure.

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:16.880
What do you mean, a failure?

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:19.710
We annihilated all these pests!
It was a complete success!

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:21.460
I made no mistake in command!

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:23.380
The boat's gone.

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:26.130
How do we get to our target?

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:30.080
Okay, it's gone. But with me in command
we'll find another way!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:32.750
You have no command ability whatsoever!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:36.130
We'll inform the general that I'll be in
complete command for the rest of the mission.

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:39.330
Hey, signalman! Contact HQ at once!

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:40.170
Yes, sir!

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:41.540
That won't be necessary.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:42.960
What?

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:49.250
It's one of ours.

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:50.920
When did you...?

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:53.170
This is my decision.

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:58.380
We ignored HQ's mission,
and now we'll take responsibility.

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:07.170
Vanilla!

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:12.790
Airman second class Vanilla Vartla of
Assemble EX-10's third air squadron,

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:14.790
reporting for special duty, sir!

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:17.750
Chirico, you're still alive!

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:21.290
You little... Not even a scratch on you!

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:24.170
You old dog!
Everybody's been worried about you!

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:29.960
I see. You went and volunteered.

00:21:29.960 --> 00:21:34.080
Yeah, thanks to the old man.
He got Gon Nu to okay this.

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:42.830
Never thought I'd say this,
but I feel right at home.

00:21:44.380 --> 00:21:46.380
Oh, yeah. The report! The report!

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:50.080
Message from General Gon Nu, sir!

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:52.630
The special task force's mission
has been changed

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:54.540
and you are to set off onto a new route.

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:58.330
Details will follow. Stand by for now. That is all.

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:00.920
He didn't say anything else?

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:05.130
We swept these ambush troops out of Ramoh
and we've had to change command, too.

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:06.670
Oh, that.

00:22:07.210 --> 00:22:09.790
He said something about booting out
the incompetent commander

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:12.420
who blew such an important secret mission.

00:22:12.420 --> 00:22:13.580
Never mind!

00:22:13.580 --> 00:22:14.880
But there's more!

00:22:15.130 --> 00:22:17.880
Chirico's supposed to have
complete command from now on.

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:22.710
What is it that leads men to the battlefield?

00:22:25.790 --> 00:22:29.130
For some, they pull the trigger
to earn their daily bread.

00:22:30.710 --> 00:22:32.830
For others, the chance to fight for their ideals.

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:38.710
For me, I can't live without
the scent of gunpowder and death.

00:22:40.460 --> 00:22:42.460
This was no longer a house of God.

00:22:43.210 --> 00:22:45.210
It was merely a pile of rubble now.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
Next Episode

00:22:55.960 --> 00:22:58.670
Everything began with a grand coincidence.

00:22:59.080 --> 00:23:00.830
A budding consciousness moves to action.

00:23:00.830 --> 00:23:04.790
Action becomes passion.
Passion becomes ideals.

00:23:05.210 --> 00:23:07.540
And ideals finally become love.

00:23:08.170 --> 00:23:12.580
A love that is mercilessly interfered with
will grow into a storm of creation.

00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:16.420
And who will be struck
when it finally releases its lightning?

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:19.040
Next time, "Contact Blast"

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:21.540
There is no such thing as
a meaningless coincidence.

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:24.290
Contact Blast

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Whenever I'm feeling lonely

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Whenever I'm feeling sad

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
I can always see you floating in my mind

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Whenever I'm alone

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.380
Whenever I long for you

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
I can always feel you inside my heart

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
No matter how far apart we may go

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
No matter if my path should part from yours

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
The memories of you seem to shine inside my heart...

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Brighter than any other light...
